 "captions": [
  {
   "t0": 0.245,
   "t1": 1.79,
   "text": "It's not just the sea.",
   "line": "ch6_hook"
  },
  {
   "t0": 1.81,
   "t1": 2.5,
   "text": "The ground moves too.",
   "line": "ch6_hook"
  },
  {
   "t0": 3.5,
   "t1": 5.765,
   "text": "Seventy thousand kilometers.",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 5.785,
   "t1": 9.68,
   "text": "The Moon is about five and a half times wider than tonight.",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 9.7,
   "t1": 14.125,
   "text": "Its tidal pull is more than a hundred sixty times today's.",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 14.145,
   "t1": 17.16,
   "text": "The sea is not the only thing that moves.",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 17.345,
   "t1": 20.736,
   "text": "The solid Earth already rises and falls a little",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.756,
   "t1": 23.67,
   "text": "with the Moon, tens of centimeters a day.",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 23.69,
   "t1": 26.72,
   "text": "With far more pull, it would flex far more.",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 26.74,
   "t1": 29.425,
   "text": "What that would do to faults and volcanoes,",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 29.445,
   "t1": 31.08,
   "text": "this film cannot tell you.",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 31.1,
   "t1": 35.408,
   "text": "In real life, tides are why the Moon drifts away: they steal",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 35.428,
   "t1": 39.54,
   "text": "a little of Earth's spin and hand it to the Moon's orbit.",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 39.56,
   "t1": 41.845,
   "text": "To make it come closer, our thought",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 41.865,
   "t1": 44.105,
   "text": "experiment has to break that rule.",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 44.125,
   "t1": 46.079,
   "text": "That is one more reason this",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 46.099,
   "t1": 48.92,
   "text": "is a thought experiment, not a forecast.",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 49.043,
   "t1": 50.168,
   "text": "Still looking up?",
   "line": "cta2_subscribe"
  },
  {
   "t0": 50.188,
   "t1": 51.653,
   "text": "Tap like and subscribe.",
   "line": "cta2_subscribe"
  },
  {
   "t0": 51.673,
   "t1": 53.268,
   "text": "There's plenty more sky.",
   "line": "cta2_subscribe"
  },
  {
   "t0": 53.432,
   "t1": 55.027,
   "text": "And the number keeps falling.",
   "line": "ch6_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 55.218,
   "t1": 59.288,
   "text": "Because soon, the Moon will rise from the wrong side of the sky.",
   "line": "ch6_loop"
  },
  {
   "t0": 59.437,
   "t1": 60.797,
   "text": "Part six of eight.",
   "line": "closer6"
  },
  {
